  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "Which note first recorded that webhooks depends on the event-bus, and when?\n[2025-02-13] standup/boreal/2025-02-13: The notifier calls the event-bus for delivery events, so treat the event-bus as a hard dependency of the notifier. Dependency map update: webhooks needs the event-bus (outbound events). [2025-01-09] standup/boreal/2025-01-09-2: The webhooks service is a Boreal service. [2025-02-21] standup/boreal/2025-02-21: Webhooks deploy window: on Thursdays between 07:00 and 09:00 UTC.",
